  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRC - Top-up Sahel - Danish Refugee Council received top-up under the Strategic Partnership Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the intervention is to reduce the vulnerability of at-risk communities in Burkina Faso, Mali and Niger, affected by displacement and conflicts to the impacts of climate change. This will be done by strengthening their adaptive capacity and resilience and ensuring the protection of productive assets and access to essential resources and services, through inclusive community-driven solutions to preparedness to climate-related risks.

The strategic objective of the extraordinary contributing concerns objective 3 &quot;Prevent humanitarian crises and be a strong humanitarian partner during and after crises&quot; of the Danish Development Strategy  &#x2018;The World We Share&#x2019;.</narrative>
  </description>
